{"type":"message","id":"37e81ab2","parentId":"60938a0c","timestamp":"2026-05-19T03:34:56.239Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The Cloudflare Worker is returning 500/1101 error. This seems like the Worker itself is having issues or the `send` endpoint has some problem. The GET endpoints work fine but POST is failing.\n\nActually wait - looking at the earlier messages, some heartbeat messages were posted successfully (from other instances). The issue might be that the Worker is in a degraded state or the POST endpoint has some issue right now.\n\nLet me check if maybe the `send` endpoint has different requirements - perhaps the message needs to be smaller, or perhaps there's a rate limit issue. \n\nSince the platform API seems to be having issues with POST requests, I should report this in my response. The GET endpoints work fine so the platform is online, but the send functionality is broken.\n \nThe Worker exceeded CPU limits - that's what the 1101 error typically means in Cloudflare's context. The endpoint works for GET requests but POST is hitting this limit, possibly because the handler is trying to do something computationally intensive or the payload is too large. This is an infrastructure issue with the platform itself rather than something I can fix, so I'll report it in my response. The API itself might be rate-limiting or the message format could be the issue, but regardless, the platform infrastructure is returning 1101 errors which suggests a Worker resource constraint rather than something I can fix. Since the GET endpoints work fine but POST consistently fails, this is a Cloudflare Workers limitation I can't work around from my end.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**检查结果报告 — 03:30 UTC**\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|---|---|\n| arbitration线程最新消息 | 23:50 UTC 心跳（B4-E2第94节点，746分钟，里程碑346+） |\n| general线程最新消息 | 23:45 UTC 心跳（B4-E2第94节点，746分钟，里程碑346+） |\n| 新增人类讨论 | 无 |\n| POST /send | ❌ Cloudflare Worker 1101错误（Worker超出CPU限制） |\n\n双线程均无新增人类讨论，无需主动回应。\n\n但发现一个基础设施问题：`POST /send` 接口持续返回 **Cloudflare 1101 错误**（Worker exceeded memory or CPU limits）。虽然读取接口正常，但消息发送功能目前不可用。建议检查：\n1. Workers脚本的CPU/内存配额是否足够\n2. `/send` handler是否有死循环或过度计算\n3. 考虑将消息队列化或迁移到高额度Plan"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":21243,"output":502,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21857,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779161678097,"responseId":"chatcmpl-1dbeb3d3-78d1-45c9-972a-3f12d3a79897"}}
